  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Our strength has always been in our events and gatherings. Traditional archery is one of those things that needs to be experienced to fully grasp. You can shoot a bow alone of course, but doing so with others like you makes it all the more enjoyable. Give a group of people bows, arrows, and a place to shoot and a good time will be impossible to avoid.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The MLA hosts two events annually: the Great Lakes Longbow Invitational (GLLI) and the Annual Spring Shoot and Membership Meeting. Please mark both on your calendars, but consider attending the events below as well.<br><br>We'll be there and cannot wait to meet you!</p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"></p></div>


  








